
Creates a new instance and sets the property values for the new instance.
USAGE:

CREATE <assign list>
NOTE: <assign list> can be more than one property name separated by commas.
Each property name should be followed by '=' and its value.

NOTE: Create cannot be used to create a new class.

The following properties are available:
Property				Type			Operation
========				====			=========
BitsPerPel                         	N/A                 	N/A       
Collate                            	N/A                 	N/A       
Color                              	N/A                 	N/A       
Copies                             	N/A                 	N/A       
Description                        	N/A                 	N/A       
DeviceName                         	N/A                 	N/A       
DisplayFlags                       	N/A                 	N/A       
DisplayFrequency                   	N/A                 	N/A       
DitherType                         	N/A                 	N/A       
DriverVersion                      	N/A                 	N/A       
Duplex                             	N/A                 	N/A       
FormName                           	N/A                 	N/A       
HorizontalResolution               	N/A                 	N/A       
ICMIntent                          	N/A                 	N/A       
ICMMethod                          	N/A                 	N/A       
LogPixels                          	N/A                 	N/A       
MediaType                          	N/A                 	N/A       
Name                               	N/A                 	N/A       
Orientation                        	N/A                 	N/A       
PaperLength                        	N/A                 	N/A       
PaperSize                          	N/A                 	N/A       
PaperWidth                         	N/A                 	N/A       
PelsHeight                         	N/A                 	N/A       
PelsWidth                          	N/A                 	N/A       
PrintQuality                       	N/A                 	N/A       
Scale                              	N/A                 	N/A       
SettingID                          	N/A                 	N/A       
SpecificationVersion               	N/A                 	N/A       
TTOption                           	N/A                 	N/A       
VerticalResolution                 	N/A                 	N/A       
XResolution                        	N/A                 	N/A       
YResolution                        	N/A                 	N/A       

